                    <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,.8);font-size:.88rem;">
                        <i class="bi bi-shield-check" style="color:var(--highlight);font-size:1.1rem;"></i>
                        Fully compliant with Philippine labor regulations
