                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-6 col-md-3">
                <div class="step-item">
                    <div class="step-number">3</div>
                    <div class="step-icon"><i class="bi bi-qr-code-scan"></i></div>
                    <h6>Track Attendance</h6>
                    <p>Deploy kiosk mode on any device. Employees clock in with QR or PIN.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-6 col-md-3">
                <div class="step-item">
                    <div class="step-number">4</div>
                    <div class="step-icon"><i class="bi bi-cash-coin"></i></div>
